{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "لَقُوا۟", "translation": "they meet"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَّا", "translation": "We believe[d]"}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "But when"}, {"text": "خَلَوْا۟", "translation": "they are alone"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "شَيَـٰطِينِهِمْ", "translation": "their evil ones"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "إِنَّا", "translation": "Indeed, we"}, {"text": "مَعَكُمْ", "translation": "(are) with you"}, {"text": "إِنَّمَا", "translation": "only"}, {"text": "نَحْنُ", "translation": "we"}, {"text": "مُسْتَهْزِءُونَ", "translation": "(are) mockers"}], "sahih": "And when they meet those who believe, they say, \"We believe\"; but when they are alone with their evil ones, they say, \"Indeed, we are with you; we were only mockers.\""}